  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multiprofile configurations with avgpool aggregation (config_018) achieve high validation accuracy (0.6186), but it's unclear if this stems from the multiprofile setting itself or the multimodal integration. Testing config_002 (RNA-only multiprofile with avgpool) isolates the effect of profile setting and aggregation, directly comparing their impact to the multimodal baseline. This clarifies whether multiprofile benefits are modality-agnostic or specific to multimodal integration, addressing key uncertainty while maintaining alignment with the primary optimization objective."
}

